@GrillSystem_HostAddress = https://localhost:7147
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Primeiro usuário (bootstrap; será Administrador)
POST {{GrillSystem_HostAddress}}/usuario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@grillsystem.local",
  "senha": "Admin@123",
  "funcionarioId": 1,
  "perfil": "Administrador"
}

### Login
POST {{GrillSystem_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@grillsystem.local",
  "senha": "Admin@123"
}

### Usuário autenticado
GET {{GrillSystem_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lista de usuários (Administrador)
GET {{GrillSystem_HostAddress}}/usuario
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
